# Keeps patches/ in git while no pnpm patch is declared. The api, admin and merchant Dockerfiles
# COPY this directory before `pnpm install` (pnpm applies patchedDependencies during install), so
# removing the last patch must not remove the directory: after the SDK 54 upgrade did exactly that,
# every API release failed at `COPY patches/ patches/`. apps/api/src/dockerfile-sources.spec.ts
# fails CI if a Dockerfile COPY source goes missing again.
